  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health in Ukraine Pre-study 2024 - PH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">H&#xe4;lsa i Ukraina F&#xf6;rstudie 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kartl&#xe4;ggning av behoven inom h&#xe4;lso- och sjukv&#xe5;rd i Ukraina 2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping of needs within the health care sector in Ukraine 2024</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the assignment is to map the current situation for the health care system in Ukraine and identify areas where the Swedish experience and expertise can be most relevant. The mapping should answer the following questions: 

&#x2022;What are the overall current challenges and needs and what are the particular needs within mental health an SRHR? 
&#x2022;Who are the Ukrainian health care actors?
&#x2022;What do the other donors do and in which sectors? 
&#x2022;What is the relevance of Swedish health care agencies and authorities in the Ukrainian context? Particular focus should be on Mental health and SRHR, but not only. 

The mapping is to be used by EUROLATIN department and other departments at Sida HQ, the embassy Reform Section in Kyiv and by other interested parties.</narrative>
  </description>
